{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huedini is a top-down action roguelike game. You play as Huedini, a powerful wizard with the unique ability to change his colour. By matching your colour, to that of the enemies and their projectiles, you can absorb their colour essence to cast powerful spells. Collect upgrades as you progress to customise and improve your spells and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ab75fa5804cdf03a1e515628139fc93.poster.avif?t=1771731579\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ab75fa5804cdf03a1e515628139fc93.webm?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ab75fa5804cdf03a1e515628139fc93.mp4?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Huedini's three colour modes: red, green and blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/e61ec214b60d7cad39a68d86a71d81d2.poster.avif?t=1771731579\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/e61ec214b60d7cad39a68d86a71d81d2.webm?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/e61ec214b60d7cad39a68d86a71d81d2.mp4?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By matching your colour to enemies and their projectiles, you take no damage from them and absorb their colour essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ce99780911f3486d48167c7dcde4cce.poster.avif?t=1771731579\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ce99780911f3486d48167c7dcde4cce.webm?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ce99780911f3486d48167c7dcde4cce.mp4?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By absorbing the correct combinations of colour essences from enemies you can cast powerful spells, that you customise and upgrade as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2746120?t=1771731579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771731579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/65998918082efb5db3cf678170a1d5033abb2ab0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771731579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/65998918082efb5db3cf678170a1d5033abb2ab0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771731579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3939730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huedini is a top-down action roguelike game. You play as Huedini, a powerful wizard with the unique ability to change his colour. By matching your colour, to that of the enemies and their projectiles, you can absorb their colour essence to cast powerful spells. Collect upgrades as you progress to customise and improve your spells and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ab75fa5804cdf03a1e515628139fc93.poster.avif?t=1771731579\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ab75fa5804cdf03a1e515628139fc93.webm?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ab75fa5804cdf03a1e515628139fc93.mp4?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Huedini's three colour modes: red, green and blue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/e61ec214b60d7cad39a68d86a71d81d2.poster.avif?t=1771731579\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/e61ec214b60d7cad39a68d86a71d81d2.webm?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/e61ec214b60d7cad39a68d86a71d81d2.mp4?t=1771731579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By matching your colour to enemies and their projectiles, you take no damage from them and absorb their colour essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746120/extras/3ce99780911f3486d48167c7dcde4cce.poste